# Paying for "counter target spell unless its controller pays {3}" is no spell being cast (CR 118.12, 608.2d), so what
# changes the cost to cast spells does not change it. Under Bot1's Sphere of Resistance Bot1's Lightning Bolt costs {1}{R}
# and Bot2's Mana Leak {2}{U}; Bot1 then pays Mana Leak's {3} - exactly three, from three red floated - and the Bolt resolves.

